        "/v1/images/edits": {
            "post": {
                "security": [
                    {
                        "BearerAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "description": "支持 application/json 与 multipart/form-data 两种传输形态。\nJSON 形态：image 与 images 至少提供一个，合计 1-8 张；每个元素支持对象 {\"url\":\"https://...\"}（也接受 data URL）、对象 {\"file_id\":\"input_...\"}（临时输入资产）以及直接传字符串三种写法。\nmultipart 形态：图片放文件字段 image、images、image[]、images[]，只接受 PNG、JPEG、WebP、GIF，单文件上限 20 MiB；同一字段也可传 URL 或 file_id 文本。\n全部参考图 Base64 后合计不超过 32 MiB（与请求体上限一致）。",
                "consumes": [
                    "application/json",
                    "multipart/form-data"
                ],
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "Images"
                ],
                "summary": "编辑图片",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "description": "请求",
                        "name": "request",
                        "in": "body",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/httpserver.SwaggerImageEditRequest"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "additionalProperties": true
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Bad Request",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "additionalProperties": true
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/v1/images/generations": {
            "post": {
                "security": [
                    {
                        "BearerAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "consumes": [
